{
  "analysis": "Now I understand the task completely. I need to:
1. Parse the birthday notes (Valentina: 14.02, Max: 15.03.1990, Lina: 29.02.2004, Tom: 01.12)
2. Use seed.json as the source of truth for expected format and values (Valentina has year 2000)
3. Create a JSON file for the reminder system with day, month, year fields
4. Create a markdown file with the display format
5. Calculate ages for those with known birth years

The Python script expects birthdays.json with structure: {name: {day, month, year}}",
  "plan": "Create two output files in /workspace/data/:
1. birthdays.json - JSON format for the reminder system
2. birthdays.md - Markdown format for display

I'll calculate ages based on current year (2026) for those with birth years.",
