  "analysis": "I've successfully created both output files in /workspace/data/:\n\n1. birthdays.json - Contains all 4 birthdays in JSON format with day, month, and year (where known) fields that the reminder script expects\n2. birthdays.md - Contains the markdown display format with names, dates, and calculated ages\n\nThe data matches the seed.json source of truth:\n- Valentina: 14.02.2000 (wird 26)\n- Max: 15.03.1990 (wird 36)\n- Lina: 29.02.2004 (wird 22)\n- Tom: 01.12. (no year, so no age)\n\nAll birthdays from the notes have been imported, normalized to DD.MM.YYYY format, and the reminder data is prepared.",
